<title>USA: Telegen says Decker non-executive CEO.</title>
<headline>Telegen says Decker non-executive CEO.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, Calif. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telegen Corp said Tuesday that it has named Gilbert Decker as its non-executive chairman of the board of directors.</p>
<p>Telegen said that Decker, a former assistant secretary of the U.S. Army, will remain an outside director and will not be responsible for the day-to-day duties of running the company.</p>
